  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Empowerment: Dominicans &amp; South Sudanese</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRACE Cares, in partnership with our local heroes, will provide women&apos;s empowerment opportunities to Project Hearts in Baitoa, Dominican Republic, and the Base for Hope and Human Rights Organization (BHHRO) in South Sudan. In the Dominican Republic, Project Hearts will train women in basic health and leadership skills in their Community Health Leadership program; and in South Sudan, BHHRO will provide training and seed money to young mothers to start or expand their small businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
